  m_text: "Allow gameplay analytics to help understand difficulty, card choices, and where runs end.\n\nData is sent to Unity Analytics and Microsoft PlayFab, associated with generated player identifiers and device information.\n\nYou can play either way. Change your choice using Analytics on the title or pause screen."
